From 2f324fb1aee06796bb6e70741c0661bcc6805f80 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 07:35:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add in-game Options menu: volumes, display mode,
 resolution, resizable window

Options button in the top bar (and /options) opens a window with sound effects
and music volume sliders, display mode (windowed, windowed fullscreen,
fullscreen) and resolution. Settings are saved to settings.ini.

The window is now resizable; SDL logical presentation scales the game to fit
and mouse coordinates are converted to match. Sound effects no longer play at
double gain (play_sdl_sound used 1+volume/128).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NVC8aNAHSQBYiUjbHmQcw4
